<title>NEW ZEALAND: Telecom buys back further 800,000 shares.</title>
<headline>Telecom buys back further 800,000 shares.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom Corp of New Zealand said on Friday it bought back a further 800,000 shares as part of its NZ$1 billion buyback programme.</p>
<p>The shares were bought between $6.65 and $6.70.</p>
<p>Telecom closed unchanged at $6.67 on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
